  "corrections": [
    "RT1 (header): realigned to bronze — RunDate 8-19, Record Date 20-31, Label1 32-50 (was 8-20/21-33/34-53, Label1 straddled the 50-char record). RunDate/Record Date retyped int64->string (MM/DD/YYYY text, per combined-CSV polars_dtype=String).",
    "RT3 (trailer): grand-total summary line whose embedded number lengths float, so record width oscillates 108/109/110 (magnitude-driven, not date-clean) and the fixed positions are exact only at the narrowest 108-char width. Added unmapped_tail_1 (109) + unmapped_tail_2 (110) as single-char string fillers to cover the wider months without any field straddling the 108/109 record ends. On shifted (109/110) months the numeric total_* fields decode to null (inherent to the floating format)."
  ],
  "scope_note": "RT3 is a floating-position grand-total trailer; its numeric fields (total_aggregate_original_balance, total_current_balance, total_pool_count) are reliable only in the 108-char-width months and null out where the record widens to 109/110. Same layout applies to remic1 (widths 108-109) and remic2 (widths 108-110)."
}
